    "title": "Data center builders continue to pour money into Yes on 45 campaign - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By No on Prop 45, Special to LassenNews.com ,\n12 hours ago Prologis, which is planning five data centers in San Jose alone, has contributed another $250,000 to the Yes on Proposition 45 campaign, according to records filed with the California Secretary of State. The contribution brings the San Rafael-based company’s contributions to the Yes on 45 campaign through its “Modern Infrastructure Alliance Action Fund” to $500,000. Read full article\n1",
